WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
- Hardest thing is to guest on a show.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:02.983
- Yeah.

00:00:02.983 --> 00:00:05.330
- That's, it's really hard.
- 'Cause mess it up.

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:08.940
- I try to relax the new actors 'cause

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:09.773
- Yeah,

00:00:09.773 --> 00:00:10.606
- That's really hard

00:00:10.606 --> 00:00:11.510
to come on a show-
- To walk in

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:12.460
Everybody's up to speed.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.483
It's like when I did "Friends," it was,

00:00:14.483 --> 00:00:15.316
- Yeah

00:00:15.316 --> 00:00:16.770
- They were up to speed.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:18.960
They read, the script
- You were amazing

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.451
in "Friends."

00:00:20.451 --> 00:00:21.284
(crowd cheering)

00:00:21.284 --> 00:00:22.192
Did you like doing the sitcom thing?

00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:23.025
(crowd cheering)

00:00:23.025 --> 00:00:26.010
- I wasn't amazing at what
they call the table read

00:00:26.010 --> 00:00:26.980
- You were who cares?

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:28.170
Bad rehearsal, good show.

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.150
Like, no, that was so good.

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.540
That's like literally the thing
I feel like people comment

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:33.373
about all the time was

00:00:33.373 --> 00:00:35.354
when Monica's on your
voicemail, breathing.

00:00:35.354 --> 00:00:36.187
- Yeah.

00:00:36.187 --> 00:00:37.130
- And like you were just so great.

00:00:37.130 --> 00:00:38.710
Did you like doing the sitcom?

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:40.680
- I was scared to death.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.703
I had done "Taxi" a long time before-

00:00:43.703 --> 00:00:44.536
- Yeah.

00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:46.550
- But I hadn't done a sitcom

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:50.570
and so I was really nervous
and Courtney helped a lot.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:52.320
Courtney's a big help.

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.340
But that group is just

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:59.987
an incredible group of friends.

00:00:59.987 --> 00:01:01.160
- Yeah, it was good chemistry.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:03.000
- They obviously became friends in life.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:03.833
- Yeah.

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:06.109
- While was on the show and I cherish

00:01:06.109 --> 00:01:06.942
- Yeah

00:01:06.942 --> 00:01:08.570
- And it was a wonderful place to work

00:01:08.570 --> 00:01:10.578
and we ended up doing about nine of them.

00:01:10.578 --> 00:01:11.411
- I know, I watched all of them.

00:01:11.411 --> 00:01:12.528
- I was speechless
- I know,

00:01:12.528 --> 00:01:13.361
I watched all of them

00:01:13.361 --> 00:01:14.194
- I was only supposed to do three.

00:01:14.194 --> 00:01:15.920
- I know, well, that's how good you are.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:16.753
(both laughing)

00:01:16.753 --> 00:01:18.310
So yeah, I was like, people love you.

00:01:18.310 --> 00:01:20.250
I don't know if you know this.

